# Keep test/CI tooling out of the sdist. The wheel is already limited to
# src/keylab by [tool.setuptools.packages.find]; these prunes enforce the same
# for the source distribution so the fuzzing harness (and its seeded-defect
# canary) can never ship as part of the distributed package.
prune fuzz
prune tests
prune docs
exclude *_PLAN.md *_REPORT.md *_DESIGN_REVIEW.md
